Objectives        Promotion of distribution of Agricultural machinery,
                      Implements with subsidy assistance to the Farmers in
                      order to carry out the agricultural operations on time
                      for getting higher yields.

                  Value addition of Agricultural produce cultivated by the
                      farmers at farm gate level itself through installation of
                      Solar Driers with subsidy assistance.

                  Reduce the quantitative losses of farm produce after
                      harvesting to storage period and upto consumption
                      level and to increase its shelf life.

                  Value addition to the agricultural produce and market it
                      at higher prices to make profit.

                  Establishing ‘Agricultural machinery Custom Hiring
                      Centres’ to hire out Agricultural Machinery and
                      Implements to the needy farmers by reducing the
                      shortage of agricultural machinery and enabling small
                      and marginal farmers to hire high value agricultural
                      machinery with modern technologies.

