6.4 Agricultural Extension

The services rendered by Directorate of Extension Education (DEE) Tamil

Nadu Agricultural University are:

    Educating the farmers on agricultural technology through trainings,
       exposure visits, exhibitions, demonstrations, large scale awareness
       programmes and social and mass media.

    Refresher trainings to extension officials on frontier technologies
       through Training Division.

                                                       152


                                                        152
    Agricultural Information Services are rendered through TNAU Agri Tech
       portal (http://agritech.tnau.ac.in) which consists of more than 12 lakh
       pages of web-based information related to Agriculture, Horticulture,
       Agricultural Engineering and allied subjects both in Tamil and English
       Languages

    The Educational Media Centre of TNAU programmes are produced and
       uploaded. During 2023, 108 Video programmes have been uploaded in
       TNAU TV YouTube Channel.

    Agro-Technologies broadcast through Community Radio Station
       between 10 am to 12 noon on all working days is functioning in TNAU,
       Coimbatore for the benefit of Coimbatore farmers in and around 10 km
       radius.

