6.5. TNAU - Information and Training Centre
         The TNAU Information and Training Centre functioning at Chennai is

involved in conduct of various training programmes related to agriculture,
horticulture and allied sectors. During 2024-2025, the centre has conducted
41 training programmes viz. Roof gardening, Bonsai making, Mushroom
cultivation, Organic farming, Bee keeping, Vermicomposting, Preparation of
millet products, Preparation of Juice, Jam, Jelly & Pickles, Preparation of
Squash and Syrup, Preparation of Brownies, Chocolate and Ice cream
making, Organic Soap making, Ready mix products. A total of 753
participants were benefitted including 532 women beneficiaries.

